id=vollatorchd
name=Volla Torch Strength Daemon
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=blue-boy-questions
description=Root helper for the VollaTorchStrength Xposed module. Runs a tiny event-driven socket daemon (vollatorchd) that writes torch brightness (0-31) to both mt6360 flash channels on request. Install this AND the Xposed APK (via LSPosed). algiz only.
